                    "description": "Verify the integrity of feature engineering and transformation pipelines that convert raw sanitized data into the feature representations consumed by training, evaluation, and inference. Enforce version-controlled transformation logic, feature-store consistency checks, statistical validation of transformed features, training-serving consistency, and feature lineage from raw source to model input.",
