                            "howTo": "<h5>Production implementation: promote an immutable OCI artifact and verify it after push</h5><pre><code>set -euo pipefail\numask 077\n: \"$OCI_REPOSITORY\"\n: \"$RELEASE_ID\"\n: \"$MODEL_TARBALL\"\n: \"$MODEL_SBOM\"\ncase \"$OCI_REPOSITORY\" in */*) ;; *) echo \"full internal registry/repository required\" >&2; exit 2 ;; esac\ntest -s \"$MODEL_TARBALL\"\ntest -s \"$MODEL_SBOM\"\nTAG_REF=\"$OCI_REPOSITORY:staging-$RELEASE_ID\"\nRESULT=$(oras push --format json \\\n  --artifact-type application/vnd.aidefend.model.v1 \\\n  \"$TAG_REF\" \\\n  \"$MODEL_TARBALL:application/vnd.aidefend.model.layer.v1+tar\" \\\n  \"$MODEL_SBOM:application/vnd.aidefend.model.sbom.v1+json\")\nDIGEST=$(printf \"%s\" \"$RESULT\" | jq -er '.digest | select(test(\"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$\"))')\nIMMUTABLE_REF=\"$OCI_REPOSITORY@$DIGEST\"\noras manifest fetch \"$IMMUTABLE_REF\" > release/manifest.json\ncosign sign --yes \"$IMMUTABLE_REF\"\ncosign verify \\\n  --certificate-identity \"$(cat /opt/aidefend/trust/model-release.identity)\" \\\n  --certificate-oidc-issuer \"$(cat /opt/aidefend/trust/model-release.issuer)\" \\\n  \"$IMMUTABLE_REF\" > release/signature-verification.json\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"$IMMUTABLE_REF\" > release/immutable-model-ref.txt\n</code></pre><p><strong>Action:</strong> Promote and deploy only <code>immutable-model-ref.txt</code> after independently re-resolving the manifest and verifying its signature and required attestations. Tags are publication aliases, never deployment identity. Retain the pushed and fetched manifests, layer digests, signer identity, transparency evidence, registry/repository, and release-policy digest.</p><h5>Before you begin</h5><p>Apply <code>AID-H-003.002-G001</code> only when a model, adapter, dataset, container, configuration, or release bundle moves into a trusted registry, deployment ring, or runtime.</p>"
