                        "description": "<p>Strict adapter provenance checks and behavioral validation add friction to rapid experimentation and hot-swaps. This is usually acceptable for production or shared enterprise registries, but teams should define separate pathways for sandbox experimentation versus promotion into trusted environments.</p>"
