                          "comparison": "AID-H-003.009 determines whether the artifact contains known unsafe serialization or malware indicators; AID-H-003.006 verifies the artifact's declared composition and provenance.\nA trusted attestation does not make unsafe bytes executable, and a clean scan does not establish provenance."
