              "description": "Treat every derived deployment artifact, post-training optimization, model merge, format conversion, or serving-time model pairing as a security-relevant change that requires signed source-to-candidate lineage and a pre/post behavioral regression gate. Covered changes include quantization, pruning, training-based teacher-student distillation, weight or adapter merging, ONNX export, GGUF conversion, TensorRT engine compilation, and adding or changing a speculative-decoding draft model. Promotion fails when lineage is unverifiable, required evaluation populations are missing, or task-quality, jailbreak, prompt-injection, leakage, harmful-content, or tool-policy behavior regresses beyond policy.",
