                    "description": "Protect the evaluator mechanism that turns captured candidate behavior into scores and gate decisions: judge-model digests, grader or scoring code, rubric and judge-prompt templates, dependencies, harness orchestration, threshold policy, and evidence-writer configuration. Prevent the evaluated system or its identity from reading protected evaluator internals or modifying evaluator inputs, logic, results, or signatures.",
