                    "description": "Before executing a high-impact tool call such as a payment, infrastructure change, code execution, or knowledge-base/memory write, require an independent validation channel and, when policy requires it, fresh step-up or human approval bound to the exact immutable action plan. The enforcement adapter verifies every signature, identity, action digest, expiry, evidence reference, and policy version locally at the executor boundary; missing or unverifiable inputs deny or degrade the action.",
