                          "id": "AID-H-017.002",
                          "comparison": "AID-H-018.004 chooses the smallest currently allowed subset from the tool registry; AID-H-017.002 designs the registry itself around narrow, single-purpose, least-privilege tools.\nDynamic scoping cannot make an overpowered primitive safe."
