                          "id": "AID-H-016.001",
                          "comparison": "AID-H-019.002 strips active web behavior and labels extracted text as untrusted; AID-H-016.001 structures the final prompt so untrusted data cannot syntactically become trusted instruction.\nWeb sanitization and instruction-data separation are sequential defenses."
