                    "description": "Provide fine-grained RAG integrity by binding each canonical chunk, source version, embedding bytes, and embedding-model identity to a signed manifest stored in an external retention-locked trust domain, then verifying that manifest before context assembly. A hash stored beside content in the same vector database is not accepted as evidence because a vector-store writer could alter both.",
