                          "id": "AID-I-004.002",
                          "comparison": "AID-H-020.003 filters documents and chunks for a principal at retrieval time; AID-I-004.002 partitions persistent memory and knowledge namespaces by tenant and trust zone.\nNamespace isolation limits addressability, while entitlement applies record-level source permissions."
