                    "description": "Install dependencies only from signature-verified, promoted offline caches inside ephemeral no-network build containers with digest-pinned builders, read-only inputs, policy-derived resource limits, install-script/source-build denial, deterministic dependency-layer export, and independently signed promotion evidence. The application build consumes the exact verified layers rather than reinstalling elsewhere.",
