                          "id": "AID-H-004.002",
                          "comparison": "AID-H-028.002 protects credentials in the MCP client and their local lifecycle; AID-H-004.002 defines service and API authentication controls across the broader system.\nSecure storage does not determine whether the remote service accepts the credential correctly."
