                    "description": "Under MCP <code>2026-07-28</code>, isolate every request's authenticated server origin, client identity, capabilities, tenant, trace context, token, cache scope, and explicit application handles. Honor <code>ttlMs</code> and <code>cacheScope</code>, expire artifacts under versioned policy, and prevent private cache, handles, tokens, or context from crossing authorization boundaries.",
