                          "id": "AID-H-009.005",
                          "comparison": "AID-H-032.004 decides whether external inference placement evidence satisfies workload policy; AID-H-009.005 verifies the confidential-computing attestation and binds it to key release.\nProvider placement consumes rather than substitutes for local attestation verification."
